  unitName: Queen Lavinia (EU)
  unitId: 760145
  unitNumber: 7077
  description: All hail Queen Lavinia of the Shadows Whispering. She is the greatest
    being of the all realms. She has no spies, no influence! Please, follow her and
    love all the spiders! All those who kill spiders must be punished! -Nobody has
    been threatened in the writing of this description.
  summonDesc: You don't know me. But my spies do know you. With your name I heard
    whispers of great powers.
  fusionDesc: My web spins. I hear everything. I have control.
  evoDesc: This strength will spin my web. More Spies. More Whispers.
